      "statement": "`useEditorSession` creates exactly one `ModelSession` per editor window in a ref and rebuilds the whole editor snapshot — `document`, `graph`, lifecycle swimlane `layout`, `selection`, undo/redo flags and `validation` — from that session on every commit; every edit path (inspector, keyboard, Pi agent patch, MCP patch) dispatches through the same session, so all of them share one undo history.",
